  "name": "Extension groups",
  "version": "1",
  "docs": {
    "description": "Operations grouped by the path x-fern-sdk-group-name states, compiled with grouping=extension: a dotted string, a list of segments, a path nested in another that holds operations of its own, an operation stating no path and one whose value names none, both grouped by their tags, a callback filed with its parent and a webhook in the webhook group. The paths an operation's aliases name in x-forge-aliases each get a group holding no operation, for a remount to name."
  },
